# React UI

## Placement

- Shared UI belongs in `packages/shell-ui` (its `package.json` is at `packages/shell-ui/src/package.json` — do not invent a second package root).
- `programs/<name>/src/App.tsx` stays thin: compose shared UI, do not reimplement it.
- `main.tsx` / `index.html` stay per-program entrypoints.

## Theme

- Nord tokens live in the existing `styles/modules/themes/nord-theme.css` files.
- Do not add a second theme system or hard-code a parallel palette.
- Prefer defining tokens once in `packages/shell-ui` and importing; do not fork tokens per program.

## Anti-duplication

```tsx
// BAD — same widget copied into editor, explorer, and terminal
// GOOD — widget in packages/shell-ui; each App.tsx imports it
```
